# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# exzibo-realtime — Cloudflare Worker local-development secrets
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in real values. NEVER commit real values to Git.
# These are secret bindings for `wrangler dev` / `wrangler deploy`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Required. Used by the backend to authenticate publish requests.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
PUBLISH_SECRET=your_32_char_publish_secret_here

# Required. Used to sign WebSocket tickets.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
REALTIME_TICKET_SECRET=your_32_char_ticket_secret_here
